  <Properties>
    <metaDescription>
      <Value><![CDATA[In the latest 3chillies blog we unpack five takeaways from the recent Optimizely Opticon keynote and explore what it tells us about the new AI agents that are included with the Optimizely Opal product.]]></Value>
    </metaDescription>
